  {
    "start": "00:06:33.123",
    "end": "00:06:35.626",
    "start_seconds": 393.123,
    "end_seconds": 395.626,
    "text": "To safety, to safety, to safety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:35.659",
    "end": "00:06:38.262",
    "start_seconds": 395.659,
    "end_seconds": 398.262,
    "text": "To safety, to safety, to safety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:38.295",
    "end": "00:06:40.731",
    "start_seconds": 398.295,
    "end_seconds": 400.731,
    "text": "To safety, to safety, to safety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:40.764",
    "end": "00:06:44.601",
    "start_seconds": 400.764,
    "end_seconds": 404.601,
    "text": "To safety, to safety, to safety"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:45.903",
    "end": "00:06:51.742",
    "start_seconds": 405.903,
    "end_seconds": 411.742,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:56.780",
    "end": "00:06:58.081",
    "start_seconds": 416.78,
    "end_seconds": 418.081,
    "text": "Wow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:58.482",
    "end": "00:06:59.850",
    "start_seconds": 418.48199999999997,
    "end_seconds": 419.85,
    "text": "Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.418",
    "end": "00:07:04.221",
    "start_seconds": 421.418,
    "end_seconds": 424.221,
    "text": "I would like to invite my lovely partner on stage for this,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:04.221",
    "end": "00:07:06.457",
    "start_seconds": 424.221,
    "end_seconds": 426.457,
    "text": "Tracey K, please come on stage."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:07.591",
    "end": "00:07:11.161",
    "start_seconds": 427.591,
    "end_seconds": 431.161,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:13.030",
    "end": "00:07:14.731",
    "start_seconds": 433.03,
    "end_seconds": 434.731,
    "text": "This one is for your heart."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:15.499",
    "end": "00:07:17.067",
    "start_seconds": 435.499,
    "end_seconds": 437.067,
    "text": "(Guitar music)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:19.570",
    "end": "00:07:21.705",
    "start_seconds": 439.57,
    "end_seconds": 441.705,
    "text": "Well, I’ll tell you the truth"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.440",
    "end": "00:07:28.679",
    "start_seconds": 443.44,
    "end_seconds": 448.679,
    "text": "As I only do, my friend"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:31.482",
    "end": "00:07:34.751",
    "start_seconds": 451.48199999999997,
    "end_seconds": 454.751,
    "text": "I'll been living my youth"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:35.719",
    "end": "00:07:38.322",
    "start_seconds": 455.719,
    "end_seconds": 458.322,
    "text": "As I live till my end"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:38.355",
    "end": "00:07:40.457",
    "start_seconds": 458.355,
    "end_seconds": 460.457,
    "text": "My friend"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:43.660",
    "end": "00:07:46.497",
    "start_seconds": 463.65999999999997,
    "end_seconds": 466.497,
    "text": "I've been battered and bruised"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:46.930",
    "end": "00:07:52.636",
    "start_seconds": 466.93,
    "end_seconds": 472.636,
    "text": "But it's only a few that have stayed or left"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:53.537",
    "end": "00:07:56.607",
    "start_seconds": 473.537,
    "end_seconds": 476.60699999999997,
    "text": "And that's nothing a hammer"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:56.640",
    "end": "00:08:00.644",
    "start_seconds": 476.64,
    "end_seconds": 480.644,
    "text": "A nail or my mind couldn't cure"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:03.480",
    "end": "00:08:06.416",
    "start_seconds": 483.48,
    "end_seconds": 486.416,
    "text": "But I've left people hang"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:06.450",
    "end": "00:08:08.819",
    "start_seconds": 486.45,
    "end_seconds": 488.819,
    "text": "On a stick or a word"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:08.852",
    "end": "00:08:12.990",
    "start_seconds": 488.852,
    "end_seconds": 492.99,
    "text": "If their grip grew tight"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:13.390",
    "end": "00:08:16.360",
    "start_seconds": 493.39,
    "end_seconds": 496.36,
    "text": "All the bottles of battles"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:16.393",
    "end": "00:08:21.265",
    "start_seconds": 496.39300000000003,
    "end_seconds": 501.265,
    "text": "The beds that I've shared they're all mine"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.899",
    "end": "00:08:25.202",
    "start_seconds": 501.899,
    "end_seconds": 505.202,
    "text": "But the more you hold on to me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:27.237",
    "end": "00:08:31.742",
    "start_seconds": 507.237,
    "end_seconds": 511.742,
    "text": "The less you can have of me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.578",
    "end": "00:08:37.581",
    "start_seconds": 514.578,
    "end_seconds": 517.581,
    "text": "The more you hold on to me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:39.449",
    "end": "00:08:44.087",
    "start_seconds": 519.449,
    "end_seconds": 524.087,
    "text": "The less I am yours to keep"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:52.296",
    "end": "00:08:56.833",
    "start_seconds": 532.296,
    "end_seconds": 536.833,
    "text": "Yet the more you hold on to me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.969",
    "end": "00:09:03.941",
    "start_seconds": 538.969,
    "end_seconds": 543.941,
    "text": "I'll try not to leave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:05.609",
    "end": "00:09:06.810",
    "start_seconds": 545.609,
    "end_seconds": 546.81,
    "text": "Peace on earth."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:06.810",
    "end": "00:09:08.245",
    "start_seconds": 546.81,
    "end_seconds": 548.245,
    "text": "Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:08.278",
    "end": "00:09:15.218",
    "start_seconds": 548.278,
    "end_seconds": 555.218,
    "text": "(Cheers and applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.388",
    "end": "00:09:20.390",
    "start_seconds": 558.388,
    "end_seconds": 560.39,
    "text": "Hello everybody, my name is Jacob Collier,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:20.390",
    "end": "00:09:22.492",
    "start_seconds": 560.39,
    "end_seconds": 562.492,
    "text": "and I am this year's music curator for TED."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:22.526",
    "end": "00:09:24.661",
    "start_seconds": 562.526,
    "end_seconds": 564.6610000000001,
    "text": "And the musician you just heard, Wallis Bird,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:24.695",
    "end": "00:09:26.630",
    "start_seconds": 564.695,
    "end_seconds": 566.63,
    "text": "is one of my dearest musical companions."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:26.630",
    "end": "00:09:27.798",
    "start_seconds": 566.63,
    "end_seconds": 567.798,
    "text": "She is crazy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:27.831",
    "end": "00:09:30.934",
    "start_seconds": 567.831,
    "end_seconds": 570.934,
    "text": "I don't know how you felt, but the first time I heard Wallis sing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:30.968",
    "end": "00:09:32.269",
    "start_seconds": 570.968,
    "end_seconds": 572.269,
    "text": "I had tears and goosebumps."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:32.269",
    "end": "00:09:33.971",
    "start_seconds": 572.269,
    "end_seconds": 573.971,
    "text": "She's like a roof-raising musician."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.971",
    "end": "00:09:37.407",
    "start_seconds": 573.971,
    "end_seconds": 577.407,
    "text": "She accompanied me on tour, opening for some shows a couple of years ago,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:37.441",
    "end": "00:09:38.976",
    "start_seconds": 577.441,
    "end_seconds": 578.976,
    "text": "and I knew then what I know now,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:39.009",
    "end": "00:09:42.579",
    "start_seconds": 579.009,
    "end_seconds": 582.579,
    "text": "which is that she possesses that rare gift that not many musicians possess,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:42.579",
    "end": "00:09:46.016",
    "start_seconds": 582.579,
    "end_seconds": 586.016,
    "text": "which is the ability to win over any crowd with her totally wild energy,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:46.049",
    "end": "00:09:47.684",
    "start_seconds": 586.049,
    "end_seconds": 587.684,
    "text": "her joy, and her colors."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:47.718",
    "end": "00:09:51.154",
    "start_seconds": 587.718,
    "end_seconds": 591.154,
    "text": "Her voice to me is like this chameleon."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:51.188",
    "end": "00:09:53.857",
    "start_seconds": 591.188,
    "end_seconds": 593.857,
    "text": "It can change color, it can change shape, it's stretchy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:53.857",
    "end": "00:09:56.259",
    "start_seconds": 593.857,
    "end_seconds": 596.259,
    "text": "It's this magnificent instrument of joy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.293",
    "end": "00:09:59.563",
    "start_seconds": 596.293,
    "end_seconds": 599.563,
    "text": "And I think one of my favorite moments of the talk you just witnessed"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:59.563",
    "end": "00:10:02.399",
    "start_seconds": 599.563,
    "end_seconds": 602.399,
    "text": "was that moment where she goes higher and higher and higher,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:02.399",
    "end": "00:10:04.735",
    "start_seconds": 602.399,
    "end_seconds": 604.735,
    "text": "and the energy just builds and builds and builds."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:04.735",
    "end": "00:10:06.703",
    "start_seconds": 604.735,
    "end_seconds": 606.703,
    "text": "She really is unlike any musician I know."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:06.737",
    "end": "00:10:09.106",
    "start_seconds": 606.737,
    "end_seconds": 609.106,
    "text": "Hope you enjoyed. Lots of love, cheerio, bye."
  }
]
